DOL Wage & Hour Division enforcement CSVs.

Source: https://enforcedata.dol.gov/views/data_summary.php

Recognized columns (see backend/h1b_engine/ingest/whd.py::ingest_file):
  LEGAL_NAME / TRADE_NM / EMPLOYER_NAME, ST_CD / STATE,
  ACT_ID_DESC / VIOLATION_TYPE,
  FINDINGS_END_DATE / CONCLUSION_DATE,
  BW_ATP_AMT / BACK_WAGES, CMP_ASSD_AMT / PENALTY,
  CASE_VIOLTN_CNT_DESC / DESCRIPTION

By default only H-1B / INA-related violations are kept. Use --all to import
every violation type.

Run:  python scripts/ingest.py whd-enforcement
